 use  his devil fruit to avoid attacks by  letting them just pass through him which  is something that every skilled logia  user should be able to do so far we just  assumed that he has a special logia in  the same way that many of us assumed  that luffy had a special paramecia but  we all know how that turned out knowing  how similar luffy's and blackbeard's  devil fruits are in appearance  i wouldn't be surprised if blackbeard  lied about his devil fruit being a logia  in order to mislead everyone about its  true power and potential what if his  real devil fruit is a mythical zone that  grants him the power of a god just like  luffy's only his might be the moon god  or the god of darkness or something  along those lines if you want to examine  this concept in greater detail check out  the full video on blackbeard's real  devil fruit power link in the  description let me know what you guys  think down in the comments are there  more devil fruits out there with godly  powers like luffy's nika devil fruit and  if so is luffy going to have to face off  against them at some point in the future  will blackbeard turned out to be luffy's  ultimate rival the man with a devil  fruit as strong as his own don't forget  to leave your thoughts i always like  hearing from you if you guys enjoyed  this video and you want to see more one  piece content right here on the channel  please leave a like and comment it only  takes a second but it helps a lot with  that youtube algorithm and if you're new  to the channel or maybe you watch our  videos but you just haven't taken the  time to subscribe yet do me a quick  favor and make this the video that you  subscribe and hit that notification bell  to turn on all notifications you can  also hit me up on twitter and instagram  at animeopror as always thank you guys  so much for watching and until next time  see ya space cowboys

