his limits and do the impossible  in the pursuit of true freedom and that  is why the nika fruit awakened in this  moment  for the first time since joy boy the  nika fruit found a user who has the  vision imagination and determination to  unlock its true power and potential  so in my opinion luffy's new cartoonish  power wasn't just a stylistic choice by  oda gear fifth literally represents true  freedom and not just freedom in the  conventional sense it's not just freedom  to do whatever you want without someone  else stopping you gear fifth symbolizes  freedom from all restraints even the  restraints of reality itself the best  way that i can explain this is by  referring to zen buddhism which has  certainly been a clear inspiration for  oda over the course of the series now i  am not a zen master but i do practice  zazen and this is how i understand it  true freedom means complete  non-attachment it means truly letting go  of everything and this doesn't just mean  letting go of all your material  possessions which is merely the first  step for monks who decide to leave home  and embrace a monastic life letting go  of everything means letting go of all  conceptual thinking all attachment to  quote unquote reality when we say that  something is realistic it means that it  matches up with all of our preconceived  notions about what is possible and  impossible scientific and unscientific  logical and illogical but what if those  preconceived notions did not exist what  if you were like a newborn child  completely free from all classifications  definitions and limitations what if you  looked at the world with a completely  clear and open mind what if the sentence  the birds are flying through the sky and  the sentence the fish are dancing in the  trees were both the same thing to you  and one was not more or less plausible  than the other that would be true  freedom nothing to hold on to nothing to  limit you nothing to classify you or be  classified by you no biases no  preconceived notions no concepts at all  just infinite possibility that is the  true nature of luffy's new power the  power of infinite potential with luffy's  childish innocence and endless  determination it goes without saying  that he will be able to take his new  abilities to incredible heights and the  better he gets at using this power the  more he may be able to warp reality  itself and shape it according to his own  whims which will make him a practically  unstoppable fighter that said there will  almost certainly be some serious  drawbacks to luffy using this insanely  broken power otherwise he would become  too strong and the story would become  boring if you're interested in what  kinds of drawbacks luffy might  experience until he learns to truly  master gear 5th check out my video in  which i talked about the possibility  that luffy's devil fruit could be  devouring him from the inside link in  the description but assuming that luffy  will learn to control and master his new  power who could possibly challenge him  now who can stand against an awakened  devil fruit with the power of a literal  god a power that allows its user to bend  reality itself could there be other  devil fruits out there with straight up  godly powers that are able to actually  challenge luffy's newfound abilities and  make the story even more interesting as  we approach the final epic arcs well we  just recently dropped a video here on  the channel which speculated that  blackbeard may also have a mythical zone  fruit with a power that is equal to and  the perfect counterpart of luffy's sun  god the devil fruit in the past  blackbeard has straight up said that his  devil fruit is the most dangerous power  in the history of all devil fruits and  he also said that his devil fruit chose  him as if it had a will of its own we  already know that blackbeard's devil  fruit possesses properties that are not  consistent with its classification as a  logia for example blackbeard cannot use  his devil fruit to avoid attacks by  letting them just pass through him which  is something that every skilled logia  user should be able to do so far we just  assumed that he has a special logia in  the same way that many of us assumed  that luffy had a special paramecia but  we all know how that turned out knowing  how similar luffy's and blackbeard's  devil fruits are in appearance  i wouldn't be surprised if blackbeard  lied about his devil fruit being a logia  in order to mislead everyone about its  true power and potential what if his  real devil fruit is a mythical zone that  grants him the power of a god just like  luffy's only his might be the moon god  or the god of darkness or something  along those lines if you want to examine  this concept in greater detail check out  the full video on blackbeard's real  devil fruit power link in the  description let me know what you guys  think down in the comments are there  more devil fruits out there with godly  powers like luffy's nika devil fruit and  if so is luffy going to have to face off  against them at some point in the future  will blackbeard turned out to be luffy's  ultimate rival the man with a devil  fruit as strong as his own don't forget  to leave your thoughts i always like  hearing from you if you guys enjoyed  this video and you want to see more one  piece content right here on the channel  please leave a like and comment it only  takes a second but it helps a lot with  that youtube algorithm and if you're new  to the channel or maybe you watch our  videos but you just haven't taken the  time to subscribe yet do me a quick  favor and make this the video that you  subscribe and hit that notification bell  to turn on all notifications you can  also hit me up on twitter and instagram  at animeopror as always thank you guys  so much for watching and until next time  see ya space cowboys
 

